realization below when |X|≥3 and the already installed proper-cancellation replacement when |X|2,
and the exact one-P1/proper-cancellation/inverse-P1 composition below when |X|1. The empty-residual
slide now uses the exact moved-edge four-move source composition in the preceding step; its endpoint
has the same incoming-list effect. Finiteness is explicit: each slide strictly decreases the chosen
