is a different label. Use ONE Gallier–Xu P1, Definition6.3 p84, replacing h by fresh d e in ALL its
occurrences and h⁻¹, if paired elsewhere, by e⁻¹d⁻¹. This uses the installed parameter-preserving
circular-disk P1 realization from the proper-move step, not an added boundary collapse or a new
subdivision theorem. The original interval parameter of h is split at1/2; its paired inverse uses
