coproduct quotient-map or compactness theorem. Surviving labels need not all be paired; unpaired
surviving boundary sides are carried parameterwise. No auxiliary word padding, extra boundary
collapse or new finite-move algorithm is introduced. All |X|<3 cases remain outside THIS LEE
component. The |X|2 whole endpoint map is covered by the existing proper Seifert–Threlfall
replacement; |X|1 is now covered by the exact P1/proper-Seifert–Threlfall/inverse-P1 source
composition above. Empty-residual vertex slides are now covered separately by the preceding
moved-edge P1/proper-cut/proper-merge/inverse-P1 composition; the whole chosen composite has now
passed independent complete-source review at this node’s own level. The protected-root spur is
retained and never folded; no realization obligation for deleting it is added. The original
